le=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">MYB</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>NFIB</em> fusion</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">MYBL1</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>NFIB</em> fusion (rare)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">Cutaneous mixed tumour</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 477.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"637\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">PLAG1</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\"> fusions</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">HMGA2</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\"> fusions (rare)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cylindroma, spiradenoma, and malignant tumours evolving therefrom</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 477.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"637\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CYLD</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\"> mutations</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">ALPK1</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\"> p.V1092A mutation and <em>TP53</em> mutations (so far reported in spiradenoma and its malignant transformation)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">Digital papillary adenocarcinoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 477.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"637\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">BRAF</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\"> (in a subset of cases), <em>TP53</em> mutations (rare)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Hidradenoma, hidradenocarcinoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 477.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"637\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CRTC1</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>MAML2</em> fusion</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CRTC3</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>MAML2</em> fusion (rare)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">Microcystic adnexal carcinoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 477.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"637\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">TP53</span></em><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">, <em>JAK1</em> pathway mutations (rare)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Myoepithelial tumour</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 477.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"637\